      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Brazil Congress Legislative Bills & Tax Regulatory Risk Radar Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nMonitors Brazilian Chamber of Deputies (Camara dos Deputados API v2) legislative bills (PL, PLP, PEC, MPV). Filters by sector/tax keyword, extracts official summary (ementa), presentation date, and Regulatory Risk Scores (0-100).\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/brazil-camara-legislative-regulatory-risk-radar](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-camara-legislative-regulatory-risk-radar)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: brazil-camara-legislative-regulatory-risk-radar** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
